gy services and solutions company. It operates through two segments, Completion Fluids & Products; and Water & Flowback Services. The Completion Fluids & Products segment manufactures and markets clear brine fluids, additives, and associated products and services to the oil and gas industry for use in well drilling, completion, and workover operations in the United States, as well as in Latin America, Europe, Asia, the Middle East, and Africa. This segment also markets liquid and dry calcium chloride products; and TETRA PureFlow ultra-pure zinc bromide to battery technology companies. Its Water & Flowback Services segment provides water management services for onshore oil and gas operators. This segment also offers frac flowback, early production facilities and services, production well testing, and other associated services in oil and gas producing regions in the United States, as well as in various basins in Latin America, Europe, and the Middle East. The company was incorporated in 1981 and is headquartered in Spring, Texas.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Brady M. Murphy | President, CEO & Director | Age 65 | Compensation: $3.8M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $451K ranks in the bottom quartile among Energy peers. Each employee generates $14K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $5K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 8\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["Tetra Technologies, Inc. is a small-cap energy business with a $948M market cap on $631M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +4% over the past three years and -6% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 7% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and 15% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The business throws off $20M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 3 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 33.40\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 1.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 3.3\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 5.5% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 119% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.1947395219001067},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.7% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Energy sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"TETRA Technologies (TTI): Water Margins Expand as Desalination Projects Await Commercial Progress","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/tetra-technologies-tti-water-margins-175205799.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794505925.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.935,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Why TETRA Technologies' (NYSE:TTI) Shaky Earnings Are Just The Beginning Of Its Problems","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/energy/nyse-tti/tetra-technologies/news/why-tetra-technologies-nysetti-shaky-earnings-are-just-the-b","date":"2026-11-09","timestamp":1794223971.47,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.557,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"(TTI) Movement as an Input in Quant Signal Sets","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/38/TTI_Movement_as_an_Input_in_Quant_Signal_Sets_110826042002_1794129602.html","date":"2026-11-08","timestamp":1794129602.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Tetra Technologies Inc (TTI) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Record Q3 Revenue of $168 ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/tetra-technologies-inc-tti-q3-130426139.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793797466.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.691,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Calumet, Gevo, Northern Oil and Gas, Borr Drilling, and TETRA Technologies shares skyrocket, what you need to know","source":"stockstory.org","link":"https://stockstory.org/us/stocks/nasdaq/clmt/news/why-up-down/calumet-gevo-northern-oil-and-gas-borr-drilling-and-tetra-technologies-shares-skyrocket-what-you-need-to-know","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794515446.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.586,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Tidewater, Borr Drilling, TETRA Technologies, ProPetro, and HighPeak Energy stocks trade up, what you n